:: Striking Lesson
<<if $mmagymintro is 1 and $phase is 0>><<pass 20>><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>

<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1>>
    <<mmagymintro "Kicking Lesson">>
<<else>>
    <<tiredness 4>><<wearandtear>><<npc Riley>><<person1>>
    <<cleareventpool>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(0)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Precision Target Kicks">>
            Riley raises the focus mitts, shifting them between different angles. "I call the shot, you land it. No wild swings, no guessing. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You square up, focusing on each call.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                Your kicks hit the exact spot Riley calls out—no wasted movement, perfect control.  
                <br><br>
                Riley nods slightly. "That's how you land a shot clean."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                Most of your kicks land well, but a few are slightly off.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "If it ain't precise, it ain't effective. Clean it up."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                You react late, and your kicks land inconsistently.  
                <br><br>
                Riley exhales. "You hesitate, you miss. Fix that."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your timing is completely off. You're either too early, too late, or missing entirely.  
                <br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That ain't landing a kick. That's flailing."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(1)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Heavy Bag Power Kicks">>
            Riley stands behind the heavy bag, arms crossed. "No soft taps. I wanna see that bag move. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You plant your stance and start kicking.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                Every kick smashes into the bag, making it swing hard.  
                <br><br>
                Riley smirks. "That's force. Keep it up."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                You land solid kicks, but a few lack follow-through.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You hit, but you don't drive through. Power comes from commitment."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                Your kicks are inconsistent, some barely moving the bag.  
                <br><br>
                Riley frowns. "That bag ain't moving. That means you ain't hitting hard enough."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your strikes are weak and sloppy, legs already feeling the burn.  
                <br><br>
                Riley exhales. "That's embarrassing. You better start kicking like you mean it."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(2)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Sandbag Stability Kicks">>
            Riley hands you a heavy sandbag. "Hold this while you kick. If your balance is off, I'll know. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You brace yourself, sandbag pressed tight to your torso.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                Your kicks land solid without shifting your stance.  
                <br><br>
                Riley nods. "That's control. That's balance. Keep it up."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                Some of your kicks knock you slightly off-center, but you recover quickly.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You feel that shift? That's a problem. Fix it."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                Every few kicks throw you off balance, forcing you to readjust.  
                <br><br>
                Riley frowns. "If you fall in a fight, you're done. Stay grounded."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your kicks send you stumbling constantly, barely keeping control.  
                <br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "If you can't stay on your feet, you shouldn't be throwing kicks."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(3)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Counter-Kick Reflex Drills">>
            Riley raises the focus mitts. "Dodge, then strike. No hesitation. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You shift your weight, preparing for quick reactions.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                You move smoothly, dodging and countering instantly.  
                <br><br>
                Riley gives a rare nod. "That's how you punish a mistake."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                You land most counters, but a few are mistimed.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "Too slow. Tighten that up."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                Your counters are messy, sometimes too slow to land properly.  
                <br><br>
                Riley frowns. "A late counter is a wasted counter."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your timing is a mess, kicks landing weak or not at all.  
                <br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That ain't a counter. That's a panic move."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(4)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Rapid Combination Kicking">>
            Riley calls out kick sequences. "No stopping, no pausing. If you mess up, recover fast. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You focus on chaining kicks together.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                Your kicks flow smoothly, one into the next without hesitation.  
                <br><br>
                Riley smirks. "You can actually follow directions. Good."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                You keep up, but some transitions feel forced.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "You're hesitating too much. Smooth it out."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                Your rhythm keeps breaking, some kicks mistimed.  
                <br><br>
                Riley frowns. "A broken combo is a wasted combo."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your movements are slow, missing beats entirely.  
                <br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That's ugly. Try again next time."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $usedEvents.includes(5)>>
        <<addinlineevent "Sandbag Low Kick Conditioning">>
            Riley points to a sandbag. "Low kicks only. Same spot every time. 20 minutes."
            <br><br>

            You square up, targeting the same area.
            <<if $combatExtended.kicking gte 600>><<kicking 8>>
                Each kick lands exactly on target, building pressure over time.  
                <br><br>
                Riley smirks. "That'll break legs if you keep that up."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 400>><<kicking 9>>
                Most land well, but your placement isn't perfect.  
                <br><br>
                Riley grunts. "Close, but close don't count in a fight."  
            <<elseif $combatExtended.kicking gte 200>><<kicking 10>>
                Your accuracy is inconsistent, forcing you to adjust.  
                <br><br>
                Riley frowns. "You need to be precise every time."  
            <<else>><<kicking 12>>
                Your kicks are all over the place, no consistency.  
                <br><br>
                Riley shakes their head. "That ain't conditioning. That's flailing."  
            <</if>>
        <</addinlineevent>>
    <</if>>
    <<runeventpool>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $gymstage gte 2>>
        Riley checks the time. "That is 20 minutes. Session's over. Go, I have others to train."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        Riley checks the time. "That is 20 minutes. Next station. Do not waste my time."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Kicking Lesson]]>><<set $gymstage += 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>